### Health (available after docker compose up --build)
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health

### Search synthetic demo catalog
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/search?q=algorithm

### Prefix suggestions
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/suggest?prefix=the

### Lookup a demo book
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/1

### Search with core explain data
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/search?q=algorithm&explain=true

### Compare synthetic index search with linear scan
GET http://localhost:8080/api/lab/search-compare?q=algorithm

### Structure inventory
GET http://localhost:8080/api/lab/structure-stats
